{"chapter_id":"main-quest-21034","main_id":21034,"main_title":"试问，藏锋何处？","main_description":"关于寻找「藏锋」这件事，岚姐似乎改变了主意…","chapter_title":"试问，藏锋何处？","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":0,"subquest_id":2103401,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":2103401,"sequence":6,"variant":0,"line_id":210340108,"next_line_ids":[210340109],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speaker_id":2016,"speaker_text_hash":390124421,"speaker":"岚姐","speaker_raw":"岚姐","text_hash":2495651378,"text":"呵呵，我们两个那时候应该都没想到…我居然是以这种形式拿到的「藏锋」。看来，这柄剑…真的已经碎了。","raw_text":"呵呵，我们两个那时候应该都没想到…我居然是以这种形式拿到的「藏锋」。看来，这柄剑…真的已经碎了。","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/2103401.json"}
